              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kitï chane Antiokia kunyoryö pipö kanisa akïmwochï chane ngal lapay cho kegh Tororöt nko chane nko wölo kiyatïta nyinte are atökughan puntonï tïkwïl. ",
          "type": "text",
